Contemporary English:\
\
The First Unity

In the name of God, the Most Inaccessible, the Most Holy.

Indeed, I am God. There is no god except Me. Everything besides Me is My creation. O My creation, worship Me alone. I created you, sustained you, caused you to die, restored you to life, and raised you up. I made you the manifestation of My own being, so that you might recite My verses from Me and call everyone I have created to My religion. This is a mighty and inviolable path.

I created all things for you, and from Our presence I made you sovereign over the worlds. I permitted whoever enters My religion through My unity, and joined him with your remembrance. Then We declared him to be among the Letters of Truth by My permission.

Whatever has been revealed in the Bayān concerning My religion is that through which My sincere servants enter into divine good-pleasure. The sun is a sign from Me, so that in every manifestation all My believing servants may witness a rising like its rising.

I created you through yourself, and afterward all things through your word, as a command from Us. Truly, We are powerful. I made you the First and the Last, the Manifest and the Hidden. Truly, We are knowing.

No religion has ever been sent forth except through you, and no book has ever been revealed except unto you. No religion shall be sent forth except through you, and no book shall descend except unto you. Such is the decree of the All-Encompassing, the Beloved.

The Bayān alone is Our proof over all things. All the worlds are powerless before its verses.

