Contemporary English:

What comes afterward is itself the proof of what came before, which is the Furqān. The difference is this: over one thousand two hundred and seventy years, the words have advanced together with their spirits.

In every manifestation, the ruling of the latter revelation is established in relation to the manifestation before it. Thus, in this revelation, within the station of the Greatest Magnification, nothing greater than the name of the final Wise One—who was the Essence of the Seven Letters—has appeared. According to the number of eight unities, the Mirror of God remained seated upon His throne, and because of the intensity of the fire of love, no one possessed the power to draw near unto Him.

The sign of the Sun of Unity was slain within the unity of divine decree.

Whoever recites the verse:

“God bears witness that there is no god except Him, the Mighty, the Beloved. To Him belong the most beautiful names. Whoever is in the heavens and the earth and whatever lies between them belongs to Him. There is no god except Him, the Living, the Self-Subsisting,”

and afterward says:

“O God, send blessings upon the Essence of the Seven Letters, then upon the Letters of the Living, with glory and majesty,”

has believed in this Unity.

