In the name of God, the Most Inaccessible, the Most Holy.

Indeed, I am God. There is no god except Me. Whatever is other than Me, if it is guided by My guidance, is like a mirror within which the sun of your dawning is seen. That is My creation. Say: O My creation, be mindful of Me.

As for the first matter within the Third Unity: whatever the name of a thing is applied to belongs to Me, and whatever you possess is what I possess. Say: O My creation, at the manifestation of the hereafter, possess nothing apart from Me and My dominion.

Then the second: whatever I speak through truth, through it I create whatsoever I will. If it is truth, then it is truth; and if anything besides Me claims truth, then beneath that is whatever you utter. For every negation and affirmation has already been formed and then manifested through what We speak. Say: O My servants, be mindful.

Then the third: when I manifest you on the Day of Resurrection through what I sent forth before, you shall elevate what I revealed previously at the moment I permit it. Truly, We are patient.

Then the fourth: what We reveal unto you in your latter state is greater than what We revealed unto you in your former state, so be among the thankful. The superiority of what We now reveal unto you over what We revealed unto you before is like the superiority of the Qurʾān over the Gospel. Such was the superiority of Muḥammad over Jesus. Say: O My servants...

