The Fourth Unity

In the name of God, the Most Inaccessible, the Most Holy.

Indeed, I am God. There is no god except Me, the Most Great, the Most Great. I created you and established you in two stations. This is My station: within it none is seen except Me alone. From this station one speaks on My behalf, declaring:

> “Indeed, I am God. There is no god except Me, Lord of all worlds.”

From this station you glorify Me, praise Me, affirm My unity, and worship Me, and you shall be among those who prostrate.

