Then the ninth after the ten: were it not for causing sorrow to women, We would not prevent them from ascending, because of what they endure along the path. The matter concerns the land of the House during the night. Then upon their resting places, before Him, the Manifestations of the Unity conceal themselves and engage in remembrance and afterward return to their dwellings.

Let them preserve love for their husbands, their children, and their households. Do not settle into what causes sorrow, for you were created for your own souls. Do not choose journeys that would bring affliction upon you. Rather, give thanks to God for what you are spared from, for God is All-Knowing and Wise. O Manifestations of the Unity within the Alif and the Bāʾ, do not question any soul, for it knows its own judgment. Then before the One who made you guardians of the House, you shall prostrate.

