Bury the deceased in crystal or polished stone so that you may find tranquility. Place a ring upon the deceased with the inscription of the verse that has been commanded, so that you may find comfort and companionship. Say: the man records for God whatever is in the heavens and the earth and whatever lies between them, and God is All-Knowing, Powerful, and Inaccessible.

