Contemporary English:

With every soul there are a thousand houses of whatever kind they desire, so that they may find delight in them when they recite. Say: the house consists of thirty letters, if you analyze and calculate according to the number of the *Mīm*. Then write and preserve it in the most beautiful manner.

This is the first unity: in God you dwell.

Then the second: in every land you shall build a house. Refine every one of your lands and all things according to the finest degree of which you are capable, so that My eye may not witness anything displeasing. O My servants, be mindful of Me. This is nearer than all things, if you understand.

Then the third: none shall dwell in the land of the fifth except My servants who are mindful.

Then the fourth: surrender yourselves to God while saying:

“God is Greater.”

Then respond:

“God is Most Great.”

Then:

“God is Most Glorious.”

And whoever responds:

“God is Most Praiseworthy.”

Then turn yourselves toward Me.

Then the fifth: water is pure and purifying. In the vessel it bears the ruling of the sea, as you perceive.

Then the sixth: whatever you have written, replace it through the Bayān, and under its shadow you are brought forth in purity.

Then the seventh: bring the *Bāʾ* near to the *Alif* according to what We have revealed in the Book. Then be mindful of Me. Say: in the cities there are ninety-five mithqāls of gold, and in the villages the equivalent amount in silver, until it reaches nineteen mithqāls according to the descending number of the Unity.

ص ٢٥\
اذا وجد الرضا بينهما ثم من الانقطاع تتقون ثم بالارتفاع\
ترتفعون و ؟ كل واحد منها ثم كل يقولون انا كل لله\
راضيون و لقد جعل الله كل جواهر الارض مهر من خلقت لمن نظهره\
ذلك من فضل الله عليه ليكونن من الشاكرين ثم الثامن لا تستدلن\
الّا بالايات فان من لم يستذل بها فلا علم له فلا تذكرن معجزة\
دونها العلكم يوم ظهوری فی الحين لئومنون و لتقرئن ذلك\
و لتجعلنّه مدّ اعينكم لعلكم يوم ظهوری لا تحتجبون ثم التاسع\
انتم لباس الحرير ليلة العيش تلبسون و ان استطعتم؟ دونه\
لا تلبسون و انتم اسبابكم التی بها فی سركم لتعيشون\
